Output: x:BIGINT tag:VARCHAR
Project x, tag
  UnionAll inputs=2 columns=[i32, "'large'"]
    Filter i32 > 5
      Compute CAST(i32 AS BIGINT)
        Project i32, 'large'
          Scan table=e source=parquet(files=1, rows=12) columns=[i32]
    Filter i64 > 5
      Project i64, 'wide'
        Scan table=e source=parquet(files=1, rows=12) columns=[i64]
